Cabal-Version: 3.0
Name:          haskell-synthesis
Version:       0.1.6.0
Synopsis:      Shared vocabulary for Haskell program synthesis
Description:
  Parser-independent names, diagnostics, and (eventually) surface syntax for
  Haskell synthesis backends such as Djinn and Exference.
Category:      Language
License:       BSD-3-Clause
License-File:  LICENSE
Author:        Vladimir Reshetnikov and contributors
Maintainer:    Vladimir Reshetnikov
Build-Type:    Simple
Stability:     experimental

Extra-Source-Files:
  README.md

Library
  Default-Language: Haskell2010
  Hs-Source-Dirs:   src
  Ghc-Options:      -Wall -Wcompat

  Exposed-Modules:
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Constraint
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Declaration
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Diagnostic
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Environment
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Generated
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Kind
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Name
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Search
    Language.Haskell.Synthesis.Type

  Build-Depends:
    base       >= 4.18 && < 5,
    containers >= 0.6  && < 0.9,
    deepseq    >= 1.4  && < 1.6,
    pretty     >= 1.1  && < 1.2

Test-Suite synthesis-tests
  Type:             exitcode-stdio-1.0
  Main-Is:          Spec.hs
  Hs-Source-Dirs:   test
  Default-Language: Haskell2010
  Ghc-Options:      -Wall -Wcompat

  Build-Depends:
    base               >= 4.18 && < 5,
    containers         >= 0.6  && < 0.9,
    deepseq            >= 1.4  && < 1.6,
    haskell-synthesis,
    tasty              >= 1.4  && < 2,
    tasty-hunit        >= 0.10 && < 1,
    tasty-quickcheck   >= 0.10 && < 1
